{
  "about": "Questions for chatbot_eval.py. tool: the tool the chatbot should call. truth: a tool call whose result holds the right answer, and the values (paths into that result) the answer must contain. any_tied: the answer must name one of the rows tied with the first on the sort key (this field). claim: the answer must share the numbers of this text field (the six questions). Truth is computed from the data at test time, so it stays right as scores are added.",
  "questions": [
    {"id": "s01", "kind": "small", "question": "Which genomes did Rama rate highest?", "tool": "query_scores",
